      "Flight Exercise: Designing Your 90-",
      "Day AI Sales Upgrade",
      "If you're reading this on a plane, this is a good moment to open your notes app.",
      "You're going to sketch a 90-day plan--not a fantasy roadmap--for making your sales organisation smarter with AI.",
      "1. Pick one primary bottleneck  Complete:   \"Right now, the most painful weak spot in our sales engine is ________.\"   Examples:",
      "- Unreliable pipeline - Slow or inconsistent follow-up - Reps wasting time on low-quality leads - Poor preparation for key meetings - Weak forecasting 1. Map where it sits in the flow  Is this mainly",
      "a problem of: - Targeting (who we talk to) - Preparation (how we show up)",
      "- Conversation quality - Follow-up and execution - Forecasting and learning 1. Circle one. 2. Choose ONE high-leverage AI move  Based",
      "on what you've read, choose one of: - Lead scoring and prioritisation - Auto-generated account briefs before calls - AI-assisted call summaries and follow-up drafts - Follow-up agent for proposals or demos - AI-supported forecasting baseline 1. Complete:   \"In the next 90 days, we will",
      "implement a first version of ________.\" 2. Define scope and guardrails  Answer in",
      "bullets: - Where will you pilot it? (which segment, team,",
