      "ultimately accountable for this 90-day AI sales upgrade is ________.\"   If that blank is \"everyone\", it will die. 2. Plan the learning loop  Complete:   \"At the end of 90 days, we will review: - What changed in the numbers - How reps felt about it - What we'll scale, adjust or kill.\"   Put a date against that review.",
      "Congratulations. You've just stopped talking about \"AI in sales\" in abstract and designed a concrete experiment. In the next chapter, we'll shift to Marketing. You'll see how AI can reshape not just content and campaigns, but the entire way you understand your audience, test ideas, allocate budget and measure impact--turning marketing from a mysterious art form into a more disciplined, experiment-driven part of your company brain. ##"
