      "4. Learning: From Campaigns to Constant Experiments",
      "Most marketing teams technically run \"A/B tests\". Very few run disciplined learning programmes.",
      "Symptoms of superficial testing:",
      "- Tests without clear hypotheses - Declaring victory after small sample sizes - Only testing trivial things (button colours, not",
