      "- Spotting keywords like competitor names, legal threats, refund requests",
      "This allows:",
      "- Smarter routing: - Billing issues finance support - Integration problems specialised tech team - Strategic accounts senior queue - Smarter prioritisation: - Critical impact + high-value customer + renewal",
      "soon = top of the queue - Low-impact \"how-to\" from free tier = self-service",
      "first You stop treating all tickets as equal. You align effort with risk and value.",
      "3. Action: Drafting Responses and Running Playbooks",
      "At the action layer, AI can:",
      "- Draft first-response emails: - Acknowledge issue - Show understanding - Ask clarifying questions - Suggest basic steps - Propose likely root causes based on similar past",
      "tickets - Recommend internal playbooks: - \"This looks similar to Incident Type 14 - here's",
