      "- Edit, approve, send",
      "- Trigger playbooks or escalate as needed For very simple, low-risk cases (FAQs, how-to questions), you may let AI:",
      "- Respond directly in chat or email - Offer instant answers from a curated knowledge",
      "base Guardrail: anything involving money, legal terms, or serious impact remains human-reviewed.",
      "4. Feedback: Learning from Repeated Issues",
      "Support is a goldmine of product and process insight, usually wasted.",
      "AI can help you see:",
      "- Which issues are most common by product, region, customer type",
