      "warranted) Risk doesn't disappear. But it stops being a total surprise.",
      "Where Bots Fit (And Where They Don't)",
      "No support/success chapter is complete without talking about bots.",
      "Done well, bots:",
      "- Give instant answers for common questions - Reduce wait times - Collect essential information before a human",
      "steps in - Route customers to the right place faster Done badly, bots:",
