      "AI won't make your company care. It will make it painfully visible whether you do. Used thoughtfully, it will also give your teams the time, information and leverage they need to turn every problem into a chance to deepen trust--and every satisfied account into a source of durable growth. In the next chapter, we'll turn to Operations and Supply Chain--the less glamorous, extremely powerful engine room of your business--where AI can reduce waste, improve reliability, and make your entire system less fragile in the face of uncertainty. ##"
