      "4. Inventory & Working Capital: Less \"Just in Case\", More \"Just Enough\"",
      "Inventory is where fear and laziness hide. - Fear of stock-outs over-ordering - Laziness in rationalisation too many SKUs, too much old stock",
      "AI can help you run a tighter ship.",
      "4.1 Smarter Replenishment",
      "Beyond simple minimum-maximum rules, AI can: - Calculate dynamic safety stocks based on: - Demand variability - Lead time variability - Service level targets - Suggest reorder points that balance: - Stock-out risk - Holding cost - Differentiate strategies: - \"A\" items (high value/volume): tightly managed - \"B\" and \"C\" items: simpler rules, but still data- driven",
