      "this is judgment-heavy territory. 2. Opaque models where explainability is",
      "essential - Worker safety - Regulatory compliance decisions 1. If you can't explain \"why\", don't let it act alone. Use AI hardest where:",
      "- You have lots of data - The cost of a single wrong decision is low to",
      "medium - The benefit of cumulative improvement is high",
      "Common Failure Modes in AI-for- Operations",
      "You'll see variations of these everywhere.",
      "1. \"Model says so\" without domain sense",
      "- Planners defer too much to forecasts and optimisation outputs.",
      "- Local realities (supplier politics, regulatory quirks) get ignored.",
