      "At its core, the Finance function has four real jobs: 1. Scorekeeper - Record reality accurately 2. Steward - Protect cash, compliance and solvency 3. Navigator - Help choose where to allocate capital and effort 4. Alarm system - Surface risk and stress before it becomes fatal",
      "Risk, whether in a separate team or inside Finance, is about:",
      "- What can break - How likely it is - How bad it will be - What we can do about it AI doesn't change these jobs. It changes how quickly, thoroughly and consistently you can do them.",
