      "5. Build-Buy-Partner in AI: How Not to Lose Your Shirt",
      "You will face a constant set of temptations: - \"Let's build everything ourselves.\" - \"Let's just buy Vendor X and be done.\" - \"Let's sign a big 'strategic partnership' and hope.\"",
      "You need a simple decision lens:",
      "5.1 Build When...",
      "- It touches your core differentiator - It involves highly specific workflows or data",
